     "content_html": "Most European countries have single-payer health care systems."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "The U.S. has commercial insurance companies as well as Medicare and Medicaid (which is a state-run program). However, most other industrialized countries have a single-payer model similar to Medicare that covers all residents."
